Package: mec
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: MEC Project <noreply@example.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1
Description: A safe capability-aware terminal control center for MSI laptops on Linux
